\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Here Thou my prayer, O Lord,
\par And listen to my cry;
\par Remember now Thy faithful word,
\par And graciously reply.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Do not in judgement rise
\par Thy servant's life to scan;
\par For righteous in Thy spotless eyes
\par Is found no living man.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I stretch my longing hands
\par Toward Thy Holy place,
\par With soul athirst, like weary lands,
\par For Thy  refreshing grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Haste Thee, O Lord, I pray,
\par My failing heart to save.
\par Hide not Thy face:
\par I droop as they
\par That sink into the grave.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thy mercy's early light
\par My faith desires to see;
\par O let me walk before Thy sight!
\par I lift my soul to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Let Thy good Spirit lead
\par My feet in righteous ways;
\par And for Thy name's sake, Lord, my head
\par Above my troubles raise.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

